From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 05 Nov 2026 23:38:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] iwinfo: resolve embedded families and radio capabilities

Keep the libiwinfo hardware database used by rpcd/LuCI aligned with
wifi-scripts. Recognize IPQ embedded radios by their Device Tree
compatible strings. When a shared WSI endpoint links that wiphy to a
PCI radio, resolve the PCI family from the existing hardware database.
Filter channels and modes by the selected radio's frequency ranges on
multi-radio wiphys, while leaving unlinked or ambiguous hardware unchanged.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
